## C. Aditional considerations : Arquifonema /N/

| Contexto (*)                                | Realización                                      |
| ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------ |
| `/VN/` $\rightarrow$ `[Ṽm]` / __ C_oclusiva bilabial     | nasal bilabial                                   |
| `/VN/` $\rightarrow$ `[Ṽɱ]` / __ C_fricativa labiodental | nasal labiodental                                |
| `/VN/` $\rightarrow$ `[Ṽn̪]` / __ C_oclusiva dental      | nasal dental                                     |
| `/VN/` $\rightarrow$ `[Ṽn̠]` / __ C_africada palatal      | nasal palatal                                    |
| `/VN/` $\rightarrow$ `[Ṽŋ]` / __ C_oclusiva velar        | nasal velar                                      |
| `/VN/` $\rightarrow$ `[Ṽ]` / n.o.l.                      | nasalización de la vocal, en los demás contextos |

> (*) You should write it with superscripts and ipa diacritics in unicode. It's possible.
